### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000/api/users
@userId = 123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000

### 1. Create User (Full Payload)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "SecureP@ss123",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "phone": "+1234567890"
}

### 2. Get User by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{userId}}

### 3. Create User (Minimal Payload)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "AnotherP@ss1",
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe"
}

### 4. Create User (Invalid Data for Validation Test)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bad-email",
  "password": "short",
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": ""
}

### 5. Get Paginated Users
GET {{baseUrl}}?page=0&size=10&sortBy=email&sortDirection=ASC

### 6. Update User Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{userId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "SUSPENDED"
}

### 7. Delete User
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{userId}}

### 8. Get User with Invalid UUID Format
GET {{baseUrl}}/not-a-uuid

### 9. Get User (Check Headers / Correlation ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{userId}}